bin/
obj/
.vs/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
TestResults/
artifacts/
*.binlog

# Dev-only project written by `quarp new` next to a cartridge. It holds ABSOLUTE paths to
# the Quarp tools on the machine that generated it, so committing one would point every
# other checkout at a drive that does not exist. Regenerate it with `quarp new` instead.
.quarp/

# Same story, same tool, same absolute paths: launch.json/tasks.json written by `quarp new`
# point at this machine's quarp.exe. Three stage-3 brigades reported this independently.
# The repository's own .vscode (if one ever appears at the root) is not covered on purpose.
carts/*/.vscode/

# Persistent memory (Dget/Dset) written by the shell INTO the cartridge folder when a game
# is played. The owner's playtest would otherwise commit machine-local save state; found by
# the stage-3 adversary before the first playtest could step on it.
carts/*/save.dat

# Личные заметки владельца — вне репозитория
docs/NAME-CHECKLIST.md

# Выгрузки сессий разработки: содержат внутренние рассуждения агентов и полный вывод
# команд. Репозиторий публичный, а веха закрывается коммитами вида `git add -A`.
quarp-*-session-transcript.txt
